{"unit_id":"gloryxpnv__dsh-tool-vision#card-zh","repo":"gloryxpnv/dsh-tool-vision","commit":"35789ca6d71a711d09c1b9dc914f767c42b386b4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-local 是一个面向 DSH 文本模型的视觉插件，通过注册 vision 工具并提供可选的 vision-bridge，把图片交给配置的本地 OpenAI 兼容视觉模型处理。它可回答图片问题、提取 OCR 文字、描述版面与实体关系，并以结构化证据和不确定项返回结果；上传图片时还可自动生成文字描述。适合需要让纯文本模型理解截图、照片、图表或界面的用户。需要 DSH 插件加载器、Node.js 20 及运行中的视觉模型端点，不要求云端 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:451-520","lib/index.js:559-593"]}
{"unit_id":"gloryxpnv__dsh-tool-vision#card-en","repo":"gloryxpnv/dsh-tool-vision","commit":"35789ca6d71a711d09c1b9dc914f767c42b386b4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-local lets text-only DSH agents understand images via a vision tool and optional upload bridge. It answers image questions, extracts OCR, describes layouts and entities, and returns structured evidence with uncertainty. It needs Node.js 20 and a running OpenAI-compatible vision endpoint.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:451-520","lib/index.js:559-593"]}
